{"page":256,"width":2000,"height":2831,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"3.7 • TCP 혼잡제어","words":[{"text":"3.7","x":1145,"y":148,"width":40,"height":25},{"text":"•","x":1218,"y":154,"width":12,"height":13},{"text":"TCP","x":1262,"y":150,"width":61,"height":27},{"text":"혼잡제어","x":1334,"y":146,"width":103,"height":31}]},{"text":"전송률은 증가할 수 있다. 확인응답의 도착은 세그먼트들이 송신자로부터 수신자까","words":[{"text":"전송률은","x":248,"y":277,"width":123,"height":35},{"text":"증가할","x":384,"y":278,"width":92,"height":34},{"text":"수","x":487,"y":279,"width":31,"height":33},{"text":"있다.","x":530,"y":279,"width":66,"height":34},{"text":"확인응답의","x":612,"y":277,"width":159,"height":38},{"text":"도착은","x":788,"y":279,"width":98,"height":35},{"text":"세그먼트들이","x":900,"y":277,"width":197,"height":38},{"text":"송신자로부터","x":1114,"y":276,"width":196,"height":38},{"text":"수신자까","x":1328,"y":275,"width":135,"height":38}]},{"text":"지 성공적으로 전송되었고, 네트위그는 혼잡하지 않는다는, 측 모든 것이 좋다는","words":[{"text":"지","x":250,"y":337,"width":26,"height":37},{"text":"성공적으로","x":297,"y":336,"width":164,"height":38},{"text":"전송되었고,","x":479,"y":337,"width":167,"height":38},{"text":"네트위그는","x":665,"y":337,"width":161,"height":38},{"text":"혼잡하지","x":841,"y":338,"width":129,"height":37},{"text":"않는다는,","x":991,"y":337,"width":142,"height":38},{"text":"측","x":1151,"y":338,"width":32,"height":35},{"text":"모든","x":1199,"y":338,"width":66,"height":35},{"text":"것이","x":1283,"y":336,"width":60,"height":38},{"text":"좋다는","x":1363,"y":335,"width":101,"height":40}]},{"text":"묵시적 표시로 받아들여진다.","words":[{"text":"묵시적","x":248,"y":397,"width":95,"height":37},{"text":"표시로","x":359,"y":398,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"받아들여진다.","x":472,"y":397,"width":199,"height":37}]},{"text":"밴드폭 탐색. 혼잡이 없는 출발지에서 목적지까지의 경로를 표시하는 ACK와 혼잡","words":[{"text":"밴드폭","x":248,"y":472,"width":91,"height":33},{"text":"탐색.","x":353,"y":471,"width":67,"height":34},{"text":"혼잡이","x":435,"y":469,"width":94,"height":37},{"text":"없는","x":548,"y":469,"width":63,"height":36},{"text":"출발지에