"width":97,"height":40},{"text":"것이다.","x":735,"y":1015,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"ACK들과","x":856,"y":1015,"width":149,"height":38},{"text":"손실","x":1020,"y":1016,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"이벤트는","x":1105,"y":1016,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"묵시적","x":1254,"y":1016,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"신호이","x":1371,"y":1015,"width":95,"height":37}]},{"text":"며 각 TCP 송신十들은 다른 TCP 송신자들과는 비동기적으로 로컬 정보에 근거","words":[{"text":"며","x":249,"y":1077,"width":27,"height":37},{"text":"각","x":295,"y":1076,"width":33,"height":37},{"text":"TCP","x":341,"y":1080,"width":70,"height":29},{"text":"송신十들은","x":427,"y":1077,"width":165,"height":37},{"text":"다른","x":608,"y":1076,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"TCP","x":685,"y":1081,"width":69,"height":30},{"text":"송신자들과는","x":769,"y":1077,"width":203,"height":39},{"text":"비동기적으로","x":989,"y":1077,"width":202,"height":38},{"text":"로컬","x":1207,"y":1078,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"정보에","x":1291,"y":1077,"width":95,"height":38},{"text":"근거","x":1404,"y":1075,"width":62,"height":38}]},{"text":"해 동작한다.","words":[{"text":"해","x":250,"y":1139,"width":29,"height":37},{"text":"동작한다.","x":293,"y":1138,"width":139,"height":38}]},{"text":"TCP 혼잡제어에 대한 개념을 가지고, 그 유명한 TCP 혼잡제어 알고리즘(TCP con-","words":[{"text":"TCP","x":187,"y":1251,"width":67,"height":29},{"text":"혼잡제어에","x":269,"y":1245,"width":163,"height":38},{"text":"대한","x":451,"y":1245,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"개념을","x":531,"y":1245,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"가지고,","x":643,"y":1245,"width":105,"height":39},{"text":"그","x":764,"y":1251,"width":33,"height":26},{"text":"유명한","x":811,"y":1246,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"TCP","x":925,"y":1250,"width":77,"height":30},{"text":"혼잡제어","x":1016,"y":1246,"width":133,"height":39},{"text":"알고리즘(TCP","x":1168,"y":1246,"width":224,"height":39},{"text":"con-","x":1404,"y":1257,"width":69,"height":21}]},{"text":"gestion control algorithm)을 상세히 고려할 수 있는 위치에 있다. 이것은 처음에","words":[{"text":"gestion","x":188,"y":1311,"width":112,"